							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "It takes a list of gliphs names from one of the preset fonts or SVG paths and generates a custom font using opentype.js and then it generates a stylesheet with that urlencoded font that can be embedded and used."
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "There is an Icons tab on the Assets box that lists all the icons found in the Pug code. You can also add a FONTS_ICONS:"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "  potato: <svg_path>"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							},
							"content": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": "to the :yaml and the icon becomes available"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "paragraph",
							"attrs": {
								"dir": "auto"
							}
						},
